[{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0010","text":"……哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0020","text":"练习室里有灯光……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0030","text":"一、二、三、四\n一、二、三……——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0040","text":"哈……哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0050","text":"小糸……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0060","text":"啊……\nP、Producer先生……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0070","text":"辛苦了，小糸\n在自主练习吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0080","text":"是、是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0090","text":"那、那个……\n我、我已经跟家里说了……会晚点回去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0100","text":"是吗\n那就没什么好担心的了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0110","text":"……不过话说回来，\n练到这么晚，是发生什么事了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0120","text":"啊……那个，是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0129","text":"训练师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0130","text":"——好，停一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0140","text":"哈……哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0150","text":"小糸，再努力一点好不好！\n只有你的舞步跟不上了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0160","text":"好、好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0170","text":"诶、那个……是、是最近学的部分\n有个动作我怎么都做不好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0180","text":"练、练、练了好多次了，可是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0190","text":"……原来如此\n所以才一个人练到这么晚啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0200","text":"对、对不起……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0210","text":"不，这不是需要道歉的事\n我反而很佩服你呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0220","text":"不过，别太钻牛角尖了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0230","text":"好、好的……\n但是……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0240","text":"我、我想在今天之内\n把感觉……抓住"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0250","text":"所、所以\n让我再练一会儿……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0260","text":"……好的，我知道了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0270","text":"不过，继续之前先休息一下吧\n看你的样子，是一直没休息在练吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0280","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0290","text":"我去买点喝的\n运动饮料可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0300","text":"好、好的\n谢谢您……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0310","text":"“再努力一会儿可以吗”吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0320","text":"……别让她太勉强了\n得好好看着才行啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0330","text":"一、二、三、四\n一、二、三……——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0331","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0340","text":"哈……哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0350","text":"嗯，刚才那个不是挺好的吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0351","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0360","text":"是、是吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0370","text":"不、不过再差一点点……\n感觉就能抓住了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0380","text":"好，就是这个状态！\n集中精神继续！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0390","text":"好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0400","text":"加油，小糸……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_22000000_01_0401","text":"Motion"}]
